$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/4/verb

::Q001::[markdown]ἠθέλησα:{
	~%100%to be willing#Correct: **ἠθέλησα** is Principal Part 3 of **ἐθέλω** “to be willing” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%I sacrifice#Incorrect. **θύω** is Principal Part 1 of **θύω** “I sacrifice” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%make clear#Incorrect. **δηλόω** is Principal Part 1 of **δηλόω** “make clear” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%show#Incorrect. **δηλόω** is Principal Part 1 of **δηλόω** “show” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%educate#Incorrect. **παιδεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **παιδεύω** “educate” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%take part in a dance#Incorrect. **χορεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **χορεύω** “take part in a dance” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%unbind#Incorrect. **λύω** is Principal Part 1 of **λύω** “unbind” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%finish#Incorrect. **τελευτάω** is Principal Part 1 of **τελευτάω** “finish” (Chapter 10).
}


::Q002::[markdown]Pick the 5th Principal Part of γράφω.:{
	~%-100%ἐγράφην#Incorrect. **ἐγράφην** is Principal Part 6 of **γράφω** “write” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%γράψω#Incorrect. **γράψω** is Principal Part 2 of **γράφω** “write” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%γέγραφα#Incorrect. **γέγραφα** is Principal Part 4 of **γράφω** “write” (Chapter 3).
	~%100%γέγραμμαι#Correct: **γέγραμμαι** is the 5th Principal Part of **γράφω** (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%τέθαμμαι#Incorrect. **τέθαμμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **θάπτω** “bury” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%τέταγμαι#Incorrect. **τέταγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **τάττω** “draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%γράφω#Incorrect. **γράφω** is Principal Part 1 of **γράφω** “write” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἔγραψα#Incorrect. **ἔγραψα** is Principal Part 3 of **γράφω** “write” (Chapter 3).
}


::Q003::[markdown]Which Principal Part of θάπτω is ‘θάψω’?:{
	~%-100%6th#Incorrect. **θάψω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **θάπτω**, not the 6th.
	~%-100%5th#Incorrect. **θάψω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **θάπτω**, not the 5th.
	~%-100%4th#Incorrect. **θάψω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **θάπτω**, not the 4th.
	~%-100%3rd#Incorrect. **θάψω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **θάπτω**, not the 3rd.
	~%100%2nd#Correct: **θάψω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **θάπτω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%1st#Incorrect. **θάψω** is the 2nd Principal Part of **θάπτω**, not the 1st.
}


