	~%-100%free#Incorrect. **λύω** is Principal Part 1 of **λύω** “free” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%call#Incorrect. **καλέω** is Principal Part 1 of **καλέω** “call” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%(passive) be governed#Incorrect. **πολῑτεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **πολῑτεύω** “(passive) be governed” (Chapter 6).
	~%100%teach#Correct: **δεδίδαγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **διδάσκω** “teach” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%receive#Incorrect. **δέχομαι** is Principal Part 1 of **δέχομαι** “receive” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%stay#Incorrect. **μένω** is Principal Part 1 of **μένω** “stay” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%make stop#Incorrect. **παύω** is Principal Part 1 of **παύω** “make stop” (Chapter 3).
}


